        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Canonical `event` Node\n\nThe canonical node answers:\n\n> What happened, and when?\n\n## Suggested fields\n\n- Name\n- Event kind\n- Summary\n- Start date and time\n- End date and time\n- Time zone\n- All-day flag\n- Date precision\n- Temporal status\n- Status\n- Location summary\n- Geographic scope\n- Public, restricted, or unknown visibility\n- Official website\n- Primary image\n\n## Suggested statuses\n\n- Planned\n- Scheduled\n- Ongoing\n- Completed\n- Postponed\n- Cancelled\n- Disputed\n\nParticipants, organizers, causes, outcomes, phases, and evidence should remain separate nodes or relationships.\n\n## Boundary\n\nOne Event node represents one occurrence or bounded process. A recurring series is not one occurrence. Restricted data is not protected merely because a visibility field says so; sensitive material does not belong in a public graph.",
