      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Event Kinds\n\nThe template should support broad event categories without requiring a different template for each one.\n\nPossible kinds:\n\n- Meeting\n- Conference\n- Ceremony\n- Election\n- Product launch\n- Software release\n- Announcement\n- Protest\n- Court proceeding\n- Legislative action\n- Acquisition\n- Merger\n- Founding\n- Closure\n- Accident\n- Disaster\n- Conflict\n- War\n- Performance\n- Competition\n- Personal milestone\n\nThe `kind` field should begin broad. Specialized node classes should appear only when repeated examples expose a genuine structural difference.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784479326280,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
