        }
      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Declared Surfaces\n\nThe Event Template should mirror the established three-surface pattern.\n\n## Overview\n\nPublic-facing summary with title, time, location, status, participants, organizer, major phases, and outcomes.\n\n## Research\n\nClaims, evidence, sources, quotations, contested details, chronology, causal assertions, and media.\n\n## Icon\n\nCompact collection representation with event name, date, kind, status, and a small image or symbol.\n\nSuggested IDs:\n\n- `event-overview-surface`\n- `event-research-surface`\n- `event-icon-surface`\n\nThe Overview surface should be the default.",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784479326280,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
