      ],
      "visible": true,
      "showLabel": true,
      "data": {
        "markdown": "# Validation Cases\n\nTest the same template against very different events.\n\n## Conference\n\nTests schedules, sessions, speakers, organizers, venues, sponsors, and media.\n\n## Election\n\nTests candidates, organizations, voting periods, results, claims, evidence, and geographic scope.\n\n## Product launch\n\nTests organizations, presenters, announcements, media, works, and release outcomes.\n\n## Court case or hearing\n\nTests participants, roles, phases, documents, decisions, evidence, and disputed claims.\n\n## War or prolonged conflict\n\nTests nested phases, locations, organizations, participants, casualties, claims, and long duration.\n\nThe template succeeds when these can share one grammar without becoming vague event soup.\n\n## Additional hostile cases\n\n- An approximate historical event with uncertain dates\n- A hybrid event spanning physical and online locations\n- A recurring series versus one occurrence\n- A disputed participant or disputed causal attribution",
        "memo": "",
        "link": "",
        "visibilityRole": "browser",
        "_placement": {
          "version": 1,
          "state": "auto-placed",
          "source": "create",
          "updatedAt": 1784479326280,
          "reason": "node-batch-create"
        }
      }
    },
